{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43538","headline":"建元寺昼公与崔秀才见过联句与郑奉礼部同作 · 皇甫曾","name":"建元寺昼公与崔秀才见过联句与郑奉礼部同作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人闲宜岁晚，道者访幽期。\n独与寒山别，行当暮雪时。\n柏台辞汉主，竹寺寄潜师。\n荷策知君待，开门笑我迟。\n暮阶县雨足，寒吹绕松枝。\n理辩尘心妄，经分梵字疑。\n久承黄纸诏，曾赋碧云诗。\n然诺惊相许，风流话所思。\n筌忘心已默，磬发夜何其。\n愿结求羊侣，名山从所之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43538.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43538","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}